{"4395610": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Deilist: And Nothing Remains", "steam_appid": 4395610, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">- <strong>Deilist</strong> is Vertical Slice created by students over a timespan of a few months -</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>THE BEGINNING OF THE END</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before time itself, godlike beings called the <strong>Celestians </strong>ruled their own worlds - until the birth of <strong>End</strong>. Play as <strong>End</strong>, a newborn Celestian, destined to <strong>destroy </strong>the Celestians and end time itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To bring about the <strong>End of the World</strong>, you must defeat seven powerful bosses, each reigning over a unique environment with distinct attack patterns.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>OVERCOME THE ODDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this demo, you will face <strong>Celaena</strong>, the Celestial of Observation. Inspired by Greek mythology, she used to watch over the realms of her brothers. Now, she stands in your way. Behind her proud look, she is terrified of the End.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for <strong>fast and intense</strong> combat. You must <strong>dodge many different attacks</strong> to survive and reach your final goal: the apocalypse.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">- <strong>Deilist</strong> is Vertical Slice created by students over a timespan of a few months -</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>THE BEGINNING OF THE END</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before time itself, godlike beings called the <strong>Celestians </strong>ruled their own worlds - until the birth of <strong>End</strong>. Play as <strong>End</strong>, a newborn Celestian, destined to <strong>destroy </strong>the Celestians and end time itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To bring about the <strong>End of the World</strong>, you must defeat seven powerful bosses, each reigning over a unique environment with distinct attack patterns.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>OVERCOME THE ODDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this demo, you will face <strong>Celaena</strong>, the Celestial of Observation. Inspired by Greek mythology, she used to watch over the realms of her brothers. Now, she stands in your way. Behind her proud look, she is terrified of the End.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for <strong>fast and intense</strong> combat. You must <strong>dodge many different attacks</strong> to survive and reach your final goal: the apocalypse.</p>", "short_description": "Deilist: And Nothing Remains is a boss fight where you play as an evil force determined to destroy the gods. Dodge, fight back, do everything necessary to survive, for the odds are definitively against you.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4395610/9bc0eca6ff4a568a84254b54f9f14822dc0c0430/header.jpg?t=1785796083", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4395610/2896df3bd4e73ea6475c45eb19af9ccadbf140ed/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785796083", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4395610/2896df3bd4e73ea6475c45eb19af9ccadbf140ed/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785796083", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong>  Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-9600K / AMD Ryzen 5<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  GeForce GTX 1080<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB availab